12. CALCULATE ACTION
==================================================

Calculate is enabled only when:
- Required context is valid.
- Readiness passed for that exact context.
- No conflicting execution exists.
- No start request is pending.

On click:
- Submit execution for the approved context.
- Prevent duplicate submissions.
- Show a starting state.
- Highlight Validation Execution only when backend state confirms it started.

If submission fails:
- Show the actual error.
- Do not invent a run ID or execution state.
- Restore the appropriate action state.

If the backend reports that prerequisites changed:
- Invalidate readiness.
- Show returned issues.
- Require readiness to pass again.

Keep the previous completed output visible during the new execution.

